# drive-sync remotes. Copy to ~/.config/drive-sync/remotes.conf (kept out of the repo)
# after creating the rclone remotes with `rclone config`.
#
# One remote per line:  name|rclone-remote:|local folder|label
#   name    short id used by `drive-sync NAME` and the status files
#   remote  rclone remote (and optional path), e.g. gdrive: or gdrive:Work
#   folder  local bisync folder (~ and $HOME are expanded); create it before the first run
#   label   optional, shown in Thunar bookmarks and the shortcuts menu
#
# First run of each remote needs a baseline:  drive-sync --resync NAME
#
# my_drive|gdrive:|~/drive/my_drive|My Drive
# shared|gdrive-shared:|~/drive/shared|Shared folder
